<title>BELGIUM: EU, UK still far apart on BA/American - Van Miert.</title>
<headline>EU, UK still far apart on BA/American - Van Miert.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain and the European Union are still far part on how to deal with the planned alliance between British Airways and American Airlines, EU competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Contact has resumed (between the Commission and the UK authorities) but positions still differ widely on the substance of the case,&quot; he told the European Parliament's Transport Committee.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
